{'symbol': 'KSU', 'date': '2021-11-23 18:36:00', 'title': 'SURFACE TRANSPORTATION BOARD ACCEPTS CP-KCS MERGER APPLICATION AS COMPLETE, SETS PROCEDURAL SCHEDULE', 'text': 'CALGARY, AB\xa0AND KANSAS CITY, MO., NOV. 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ - CANADIAN PACIFIC RAILWAY LIMITED (TSX: CP) (NYSE: CP) ("CP") AND KANSAS CITY SOUTHERN (NYSE: KSU) ("KCS") TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE SURFACE TRANSPORTATION BOARD ("STB") HAS ACCEPTED THE JOINT CP-KCS MERGER APPLICATION AS COMPLETE.'}